%% Deployment Diagram
flowchart TB
Browser[User browser] -->|HTTPS| Frontend[React static app]
Frontend -->|HTTPS REST| Backend[Spring Boot application]
Backend -->|JDBC TLS where available| DB[(PostgreSQL)]
Backend -->|RPC| Chain[Local/dev blockchain node]
Chain --> Contract[Deployed Solidity contract]
Secrets[Environment-managed secrets] -. configuration .-> Backend
Backup[Controlled database backup] -. operational .-> DB
